  "description": "A meme that is designed to spread hate, division, or negative stereotypes. These memes often use violent imagery, inflammatory language, or exaggerated caricatures to provoke strong emotional reactions and to reinforce negative views about certain groups or ideologies. The meme in question is an example of a hateful meme, as it uses the image of a man holding a rifle in front of an American flag to portray a caricature of a right-wing, gun-owning, anti-establishment, and anti-immigrant American patriot, and uses crude, violent, and politically charged text to reinforce a toxic, divisive, and hateful message.",
